---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)" description="Independent third-party inspection from raw material to final coating." nav="services" page="service-inspection" mainClass="svc-detail">

  <section class="hero page ph-service sd-hero">
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap sd-grid">
      <div class="rise">
        <span class="tag">Service 08 of 8</span>
        <h1>Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)</h1>
        <p class="sub">Independent third-party inspection from raw material to final coating.</p>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="wrap sd-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/services/">← All services</a><span>/</span><b>Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)</b></nav>
      <p class="sd-lead">Total quality assurance for marine and industrial assets</p>
      <div class="sd-top reveal">
        <figure class="sd-pic plate">
          <img src="/images/svc-inspection.jpg" style="object-position: 50% 50%" alt="Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)">
          
        </figure>
        <section class="sd-block first">
          <h4><span>01</span>What we do</h4>
          <p>We provide independent, third-party fabrication inspection and Quality Assurance/Quality Control (QA/QC) services directly at your shipyards, workshops and project sites. We monitor every stage of the manufacturing cycle to ensure your structural steel, pressure vessels and marine components strictly comply with engineering designs, client specifications and international regulatory standards.</p><p>Our certified inspectors (AWS, CSWIP, NACE/FROSIO, BGAS) track project quality from raw material receipt through assembly, welding, non-destructive testing (NDT) and final protective coating applications. Acting as your independent eyes and ears on the shop floor, we enforce structural compliance, prevent manufacturing defects and guarantee that your assets are delivered in strict alignment with international engineering codes (AWS, ASME, API, ISO) and classification society standards.</p>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
      <section class="sd-block reveal">
        <h4><span>02</span>Why partner with us</h4>
        
        <ul class="points"><li><b>Unbiased Quality Safeguards</b>Independent third-party oversight that stops manufacturing corner-cutting, protects your capital investment and limits commercial warranty friction.</li><li><b>Certified Inspection Expertise</b>Access to highly qualified technical professionals with extensive fieldwork experience in heavy shipyards and complex industrial manufacturing facilities.</li><li><b>Turnkey Quality Dossiers</b>Comprehensive, audit-ready data books that support rapid asset sign-off and seamless acceptance by class surveyors and insurance underwriters.</li></ul>
        
      </section>
      
      <div class="sd-talk plate reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Talk to our team</span>
        <h3>Interested in Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)?</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your vessel or project and we'll come back with a clear plan.</p>
        <a class="btn plate" href="/contact/">Enquire now <span class="ar">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <nav class="sd-pn">
        <a href="/services/welding/"><span class="k">← Previous</span><span class="t">Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory</span></a>
        <a class="sd-all btn dark plate" href="/services/">All services</a>
        <span></span>
      </nav>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
